        <!--
        Amazon Marketplace Data
        =======================
        Complete list of Amazon marketplaces with their SP-API endpoints.

        SP-API Regions:
        - North America: US, CA, MX, BR
        - Europe: UK, DE, FR, IT, ES, NL, SE, PL, BE, TR, AE, SA, EG, IN
        - Far East: JP, AU, SG

        Each marketplace has:
        - marketplace_id: Amazon's unique identifier
        - country_code: ISO 3166-1 alpha-2
        - endpoint_url: SP-API regional endpoint
        - currency_code: Default currency
        - aws_region: AWS region for signing requests
        -->

